flowchart TD
  A[Current factory plan] --> B{Recovery cause}
  B -->|disabled| C[Review stopped: Enable focus]
  B -->|enabled and paused| D[Review paused: Pause focus]
  C --> E[Rendered session model site owner identities]
  D --> E
  E --> F[Click: validate identities and current plan]
  F -->|stale or different action/site| G[Reject and refresh guidance]
  F -->|same recovery site| H{Work already on exact facility?}
  H -->|yes| I[Preserve drafts]
  H -->|no| J[Existing select and load]
  I --> K[Revalidate then focus/reveal existing button]
  J --> K
  K --> L[Player separately presses actual command]
